host_about:
I am a working professional.  I have a beautiful comfortable and peaceful home at Casares Costa which is available for a short term let for rest and relaxation.  As this is a home from home I hope you enjoy this sunny, joyful place as much as I do.  HOUSE RULES:  this is a non-smoking house; and the accommodation is not suitable for pets.

As the house is in an urbanization you are asked to be very respectful of adjoining neighbors at all times.  Loud music is not permitted at any time.

Otherwise flexible.

Directions:  from N340 roundabout at Casares Costa;
Turn right for Casares (travelling from Estepona);
Turn immediately first right (up hill);
Drive to the top (over ramp) then turn right.
Remaining directions will be provided.
